# Station (CR 702.184a): each creature is tapped as the cost and its power goes on as charge counters, so Juggernaut
# (5), Gorn Captain (4) and Haywire Mite (1) take the Spacecraft to 5, 9 and 10. At nine it is still only an artifact;
# the tenth counter makes it an artifact creature with base power and toughness 6/6 in addition to its other types, with
# flying and vigilance (CR 721.2a-b).

